                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "3",
                    "text": "60 minutes on stage, spectacular show",
                    "rhyme": "o",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "4",
                    "text": "Kurt on the turns, edged up with sideburns",
