                    "text": "Collect our checks and take the girls home",
                    "rhyme": "om",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "3",
                    "text": "\"You know you rappers are lame, full time I'm runnin the game\"",
                    "rhyme": "Ejm",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "section_id": "section_2",
            "type": "kool",
            "performer": "",
            "lines": [
                {
                    "n": "0",
                    "text": "Momentum I get 'em I spit 'em with venom",
